#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:2
msgid "How to use Jupyter notebooks in Sphinx"
msgstr "如何在 Sphinx 中使用 Jupyter Notebook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:4
msgid ""
"`Jupyter`_ notebooks are a popular tool to describe computational narratives"
" that mix code, prose, images, interactive components, and more. Embedding "
"them in your Sphinx project allows using these rich documents as "
"documentation, which can provide a great experience for tutorials, examples,"
" and other types of technical content. There are a few extensions that allow"
" integrating Jupyter and Sphinx, and this document will explain how to "
"achieve some of the most commonly requested features."
msgstr ""
"`Jupyter`_ Notebook 是描述计算叙事的常用工具，可混合代码、文字、图片、交互式组件等。将它们嵌入 Sphinx "
"项目，就能把这些丰富的文档用作文档载体，为教程、示例和其他类型的技术内容提供出色体验。有若干扩展支持集成 Jupyter 与 "
"Sphinx，本文档将讲解如何实现其中最常被要求的功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:16
msgid "Including classic ``.ipynb`` notebooks in Sphinx documentation"
msgstr "在 Sphinx 文档中包含经典 ``.ipynb`` Notebook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:18
msgid ""
"There are two main extensions that add support Jupyter notebooks as source "
"files in Sphinx: nbsphinx_ and MyST-NB_. They have similar intent and basic "
"functionality: both can read notebooks in ``.ipynb`` and additional formats "
"supported by `jupytext`_, and are configured in a similar way (see :ref:`nb-"
"background` for more background on their differences)."
msgstr ""
"有两个主要扩展支持在 Sphinx 中把 Jupyter Notebook 作为源文件：nbsphinx_ 和 MyST-"
"NB_。它们目标和基本功能相似：都能读取 ``.ipynb`` 格式以及 `jupytext`_ 支持的其他格式，配置方式也相似（差异详见 :ref"
":`nb-background` ）。"

