#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:99
msgid "Rendering interactive widgets"
msgstr "渲染交互式组件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:101
msgid ""
"Widgets are eventful python objects that have a representation in the "
"browser and that you can use to build interactive GUIs for your notebooks. "
"Basic widgets using `ipywidgets`_ include controls like sliders, textboxes, "
"and buttons, and more complex widgets include interactive maps, like the "
"ones provided by `ipyleaflet`_."
msgstr ""
"Widget 是可响应事件的 Python 对象，在浏览器中有相应表示，可用于为你的 Notebook 构建交互式 GUI。使用 "
"`ipywidgets`_ 的基础组件包括滑块、文本框、按钮等控件；更复杂的组件包括交互式地图，如 `ipyleaflet`_ 提供的那些。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:109
msgid ""
"You can embed these interactive widgets on HTML Sphinx documentation. For "
"this to work, it's necessary to *save the widget state* before generating "
"the HTML documentation, otherwise the widget will appear as empty. Each "
"editor has a different way of doing it:"
msgstr ""
"你可以在 Sphinx 的 HTML 文档中嵌入这些交互式组件。为此，必须在生成 HTML 文档之前*保存组件状态* "
"，否则组件会显示为空。各编辑器的做法不同："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:115
msgid ""
"The classical Jupyter Notebook interface provides a \"Save Notebook Widget "
"State\" action in the \"Widgets\" menu, :doc:`as explained in the ipywidgets"
" documentation <ipywidgets:embedding>`. You need to click it before "
"exporting your notebook to HTML."
msgstr ""
"经典 Jupyter Notebook 界面在\"Widgets\"菜单中提供\"Save Notebook Widget "
"State\"操作，:doc:`如 ipywidgets 文档所述 <ipywidgets:embedding>` 。导出 Notebook 为 "
"HTML 前需点击它。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:120
msgid ""
"JupyterLab provides a \"Save Widget State Automatically\" option in the "
"\"Settings\" menu. You need to leave it checked so that widget state is "
"automatically saved."
msgstr ""
"JupyterLab 在\"Settings\"菜单中提供\"Save Widget State "
"Automatically\"选项。你需要保持勾选，使组件状态自动保存。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:122
msgid ""
"In Visual Studio Code `it's not possible to save the widget state "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-jupyter/issues/4404>`_ at the time of "
"writing (June 2021)."
msgstr ""
"在 Visual Studio Code 中，`截至撰写时（2021 年 6 月）无法保存组件状态 "
"<https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-jupyter/issues/4404>`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:126
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:131
msgid "JupyterLab option to save the interactive widget state automatically"
msgstr "JupyterLab 自动保存交互式组件状态的选项"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:133
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For example, if you create a notebook with a simple `IntSlider "
"<https://ipywidgets.readthedocs.io/en/stable/examples/Widget%20List.html#intslider>`__"
" widget from ipywidgets and save the widget state, the slider will render "
"correctly in Sphinx."
msgstr ""
"例如，若你创建了一个包含 ipywidgets 简单 `IntSlider "
"<https://ipywidgets.readthedocs.io/en/stable/examples/Widget%20List.html#intslider>`__"
" 组件的 Notebook 并保存了组件状态，该滑块就能在 Sphinx 中正确渲染。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:138
