msgstr "由 Sphinx 渲染为 HTML 的交互式组件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:145
msgid "To see more elaborate examples:"
msgstr "查看更丰富的示例："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:147
msgid ""
"`ipyleaflet`_ provides several widgets for interactive maps, and renders "
"live versions of them :doc:`in their documentation "
"<ipyleaflet:layers/velocity>`."
msgstr ""
"`ipyleaflet`_ 提供多个交互式地图组件，并在 :doc:`其文档中 <ipyleaflet:layers/velocity>` "
"渲染其实时版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:149
msgid ""
"`PyVista <https://docs.pyvista.org/>`_ is used for scientific 3D "
"visualization with several interactive backends and `examples in their "
"documentation <https://docs.pyvista.org/index.html#maps-and-geoscience>`_ as"
" well."
msgstr ""
"`PyVista <https://docs.pyvista.org/>`_ 用于科学三维可视化，支持多种交互式后端，也提供 `其文档中的示例 "
"<https://docs.pyvista.org/index.html#maps-and-geoscience>`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:155
msgid ""
"Although widgets themselves can be embedded in HTML, :doc:`events "
"<ipywidgets:examples/Widget Events>` require a backend (kernel) to execute. "
"Therefore, ``@interact``, ``.observe``, and related functionalities relying "
"on them will not work as expected."
msgstr ""
"虽然组件本身可以嵌入 HTML，但 :doc:`事件 <ipywidgets:examples/Widget Events>` "
"需要后端（内核）执行。因此，``@interact`` 、``.observe`` 及依赖它们的相关功能不会按预期工作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:163
msgid ""
"If your widgets need some additional JavaScript libraries, you can add them "
"using :py:meth:`~sphinx.application.Sphinx.add_js_file`."
msgstr ""
"若你的组件需要额外的 JavaScript 库，可用 :py:meth:`~sphinx.application.Sphinx.add_js_file`"
" 添加。"

