#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:299
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:304
msgid "Existing relevant extensions"
msgstr "现有的相关扩展"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:306
msgid ""
"In the first part of this document we have seen that `nbsphinx`_ and `MyST-"
"NB`_ are similar. However, there are some differences between them:"
msgstr "本文第一部分已说明 `nbsphinx`_ 和 `MyST-NB`_ 相似，但两者仍有一些差异："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:310
msgid ""
"nsphinx uses `pandoc <https://pandoc.org/>`_ to convert the Markdown from "
"Jupyter notebooks to reStructuredText and then to `docutils AST "
"<https://docutils.sourceforge.io/docs/ref/doctree.html>`_, whereas MyST-NB "
"uses `MyST-Parser`_ to directly convert the Markdown text to docutils AST. "
"Therefore, nbsphinx assumes `pandoc flavored Markdown "
"<https://pandoc.org/MANUAL.html#pandocs-markdown>`_, whereas MyST-NB uses "
":doc:`MyST flavored Markdown <myst-parser:index>`. Both Markdown flavors are"
" mostly equal, but they have some differences."
msgstr ""
"nbsphinx 用 `pandoc <https://pandoc.org/>`_ 将 Jupyter Notebook 中的 Markdown 转为"
" reStructuredText，再转为 `docutils AST "
"<https://docutils.sourceforge.io/docs/ref/doctree.html>`_ ；而 MyST-NB 用 "
"`MyST-Parser`_ 直接将 Markdown 文本转为 docutils AST。因此 nbsphinx 假定的是 `pandoc 风格 "
"Markdown <https://pandoc.org/MANUAL.html#pandocs-markdown>`_ ，MyST-NB 使用的则是 "
":doc:`MyST 风格 Markdown <myst-parser:index>` 。两种 Markdown 方言大体相同，但存在一些差异。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:319
msgid ""
"nbsphinx executes each notebook during the parsing phase, whereas MyST-NB "
"can execute all notebooks up front and cache them with `jupyter-cache <https"
"://jupyter-cache.readthedocs.io/>`_. This can result in shorter build times "
"when notebooks are modified if using MyST-NB."
msgstr ""
"nbsphinx 在解析阶段执行每个 Notebook，而 MyST-NB 可以预先执行全部 Notebook 并用 `jupyter-cache "
"<https://jupyter-cache.readthedocs.io/>`_ 缓存。因此使用 MyST-NB 时，Notebook "
"被修改可带来更短的构建时间。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:324
msgid ""
"nbsphinx provides functionality to create thumbnail galleries, whereas MyST-"
"NB does not have such functionality at the moment (see :ref:`notebook-"
"galleries` for more information about galleries)."
msgstr "nbsphinx 提供创建缩略图画廊的功能，而 MyST-NB 目前没有此功能（画廊的更多信息见 :ref:`notebook-galleries` ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:327
msgid ""
"MyST-NB allows embedding Python objects coming from the notebook in the "
"documentation (read :doc:`their \"glue\" documentation <myst-"
"nb:render/glue>` for more information) and provides more sophisticated "
":doc:`error reporting <myst-nb:computation/execute>` than the one nbsphinx "
"has."
msgstr ""
"MyST-NB 允许在文档中嵌入来自 Notebook 的 Python 对象（详见 :doc:`其 \"glue\" 文档 <myst-"
"nb:render/glue>` ），并提供比 nbsphinx 更精细的 :doc:`错误报告 <myst-"
"nb:computation/execute>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:332
msgid ""
"The visual appearance of code cells and their outputs is slightly different:"
" nbsphinx renders the cell numbers by default, whereas MyST-NB doesn't."
msgstr "代码单元格及其输出的视觉呈现略有不同：nbsphinx 默认渲染单元格编号，MyST-NB 则不渲染。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:341
msgid ""
"Deciding which one to use depends on your use case. As general "
"recommendations:"
msgstr "选择哪一个取决于你的使用场景。一般建议如下："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:343
msgid ""
"If you want to use :ref:`other notebook formats <other-formats>` or "
":ref:`generate a thumbnail gallery from your notebooks <notebook-"
"galleries>`, nbsphinx is the right choice."
msgstr ""
"若你想使用 :ref:`其他 Notebook 格式 <other-formats>` 或 :ref:`从 Notebook 生成缩略图画廊 "
"<notebook-galleries>` ，nbsphinx 是正确选择。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:346
msgid ""
"If you want to leverage a more optimized execution workflow and a more "
"streamlined parsing mechanism, as well as some of the unique MyST-NB "
"functionalities, you should use MyST-NB."
msgstr "若你想利用更优化的执行流程和更精简的解析机制，以及 MyST-NB 一些独有能力，应使用 MyST-NB。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:352
msgid "Alternative notebook formats"
msgstr "替代的 Notebook 格式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:354
msgid ""
"Jupyter notebooks in ``.ipynb`` format (as described in the `nbformat "
"documentation <https://nbformat.readthedocs.io/>`_) are by far the most "
"widely used for historical reasons."
msgstr ""
"出于历史原因，``.ipynb`` 格式的 Jupyter Notebook（如 `nbformat 文档 "
"<https://nbformat.readthedocs.io/>`_ 所述）仍是应用最广的格式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:359
msgid ""
"However, to compensate some of the disadvantages of the ``.ipynb`` format "
"(like cumbersome integration with version control systems), `jupytext`_ "
"offers `other formats <https://jupytext.org/formats/markdown/>`__ based on "
"plain text rather than JSON."
msgstr ""
"不过，为弥补 ``.ipynb`` 格式的一些缺点（如与版本控制系统集成繁琐），`jupytext`_ 提供了基于纯文本而非 JSON 的 `其他格式 "
"<https://jupytext.org/formats/markdown/>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:364
msgid "As a result, there are three modes of operation:"
msgstr "因此有三种工作模式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:366
msgid ""
"Using classic ``.ipynb`` notebooks. It's the most straightforward option, "
"since all the tooling is prepared to work with them, and does not require "
"additional pieces of software. It is therefore simpler to manage, since "
"there are fewer moving parts. However, it requires some care when working "
"with Version Control Systems (like git), by doing one of these things:"
msgstr ""
"使用经典 ``.ipynb`` "
"Notebook。这是最直接的选择，所有工具链都已为其准备就绪，无需额外软件，因此管理更简单、参与环节更少。但与版本控制系统（如 "
"git）配合时需格外小心，可采取以下做法之一："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:373
msgid ""
"Clear outputs before commit. Minimizes conflicts, but might defeat the "
"purpose of notebooks themselves, since the computation results are not "
"stored."
msgstr "提交前清空输出。可将冲突降到最低，但可能削弱 Notebook 本身的意义，因为计算结果不会被保存。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:376
msgid ""
"Use tools like `nbdime <https://nbdime.readthedocs.io/>`_ (open source) or "
"`ReviewNB <https://www.reviewnb.com/>`_ (proprietary) to improve the review "
"process."
msgstr ""
"使用 `nbdime <https://nbdime.readthedocs.io/>`_ （开源）或 `ReviewNB "
"<https://www.reviewnb.com/>`_ （商业）等工具改进审查流程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:379
msgid "Use a different collaboration workflow that doesn't involve notebooks."
msgstr "采用不涉及 Notebook 的其他协作流程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:381
msgid ""
"Replace ``.ipynb`` notebooks with `a text-based format "
"<https://jupytext.org/formats/markdown/>`__. These formats behave better "
"under version control and they can also be edited with normal text editors "
"that do not support cell-based JSON notebooks. However, text-based formats "
"do not store the outputs of the cells, and this might not be what you want."
msgstr ""
"用 `基于文本的格式 <https://jupytext.org/formats/markdown/>`__ 替换 ``.ipynb`` "
"Notebook。这类格式在版本控制下表现更好，也可用不支持单元格式 JSON Notebook "
"的普通文本编辑器编辑。但文本格式不保存单元格输出，这可能并非你想要的。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:387
msgid ""
"Pairing ``.ipynb`` notebooks with a text-based format, and putting the text-"
"based file in version control, as suggested in the `jupytext documentation "
"<https://jupytext.org/using/paired-notebooks/>`__. This solution has the "
"best of both worlds. In some rare cases you might experience synchronization"
" issues between both files."
msgstr ""
"将 ``.ipynb`` Notebook 与基于文本的格式配对，并把文本文件纳入版本控制，如 `jupytext 文档 "
"<https://jupytext.org/using/paired-notebooks/>`__ "
"所建议。该方案兼取两者之长，但在少数情况下两个文件之间可能出现同步问题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:393
msgid ""
"These approaches are not mutually exclusive, nor you have to use a single "
"format for all your notebooks. For the examples in this document, we have "
"used the `MyST Markdown format <https://jupytext.org/formats/markdown/>`__."
msgstr ""
"这些方法并不互斥，也不必对所有 Notebook 使用同一种格式。本文档的示例使用的是 `MyST Markdown 格式 "
"<https://jupytext.org/formats/markdown/>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/jupyter.rst:397
msgid ""
"If you are using alternative formats for Jupyter notebooks, you can include "
"them in your Sphinx documentation using either `nbsphinx`_ or `MyST-NB`_ "
"(see :ref:`nb-background` for more information about the differences between"
" them)."
msgstr ""
"若你对 Jupyter Notebook 使用替代格式，可用 `nbsphinx`_ 或 `MyST-NB`_ 之一将其包含进 Sphinx "
"文档（两者差异详见 :ref:`nb-background` ）。"

